Package: transplantR
Title: Functions for Transplant Reports and Clinical Risk Assessment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Laszlo", "Szabo", , "laszlo.szabo@wales.nhs.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6881-1542"))
Description: A collection of functions for transplant medicine and nephrology,
    including clinical risk indices (KDRI 2012, KDRI 2019), kidney function
    calculations (CKD-EPI 2021 GFR), data extraction from transplant PDF reports,
    and visualization tools for cumulative transplant activity reporting.
